<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Monday's close, feeder steers and heifers near steady on early trading.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts:  1,800</p>
<p>Feeder Steers:  Medium and Large 1 400-500 lbs at 56.00-63.00, (exotics 48.00-52.00).</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers: Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs few 49.25-49.50; pkg 624 lbs 49.25. Medium and Large 2 400-500 lbs 35.00-44.00; 500-600 lbs 38.00-43.50.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
